{"schemaVersion":1,"skill":{"id":"github--awesome-copilot--flowstudio-power-automate-debug","name":"flowstudio-power-automate-debug","description":"Debug failing Power Automate cloud flows using the FlowStudio MCP server. The Graph API only shows top-level status codes. This skill gives your agent action-level inputs and outputs to find the actual root cause. Load this skill when asked to: debug a flow, investigate a failed run, why is this flow failing, inspect action outputs, find the root cause of a flow error, fix a broken Power Automate flow, diagnose a timeout, trace a DynamicOperationRequestFailure, check connector auth errors, read error details from a run, or troubleshoot expression failures. Requires a FlowStudio MCP subscription — see https://mcp.flowstudio.app","category":"AI & agents","tags":["flowstudio","power","automate","debug","failing","cloud","flows","mcp","server.","graph","api","only","shows","top","level","status","codes.","skill"],"repo":"github/awesome-copilot","owner":"github","stars":39345,"official":true,"featured":false,"license":"MIT","licensePath":"LICENSE","revision":"1f5644080a525d26a2e24f61a7609fb9b261c21a","path":"skills/flowstudio-power-automate-debug","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/github/awesome-copilot/tree/1f5644080a525d26a2e24f61a7609fb9b261c21a/skills/flowstudio-power-automate-debug","checkedAt":"2026-09-24T09:18:44.317Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-24T01:29:08Z","fileCount":4,"bytes":34171,"sha256":"8c9e090767904d355de25c81c625752b456ac6f6e8c9936ed86312fdedf05d4f","historical":false},"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","sourcePath":"skills/flowstudio-power-automate-debug/SKILL.md","bytes":20015,"sha256":"8c9e090767904d355de25c81c625752b456ac6f6e8c9936ed86312fdedf05d4f","mode":420,"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/github/awesome-copilot/1f5644080a525d26a2e24f61a7609fb9b261c21a/skills/flowstudio-power-automate-debug/SKILL.md"},{"path":"references/common-errors.md","sourcePath":"skills/flowstudio-power-automate-debug/references/commo